'''Madoka Kaname''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.1 Update#Version 14.1.1 Update|Version 14.1.1]] increases health, damage, time between attacks, attack animation, grants [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target, [[Zombie Killer]], [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]] and swaps [[Strong Against]] for [[Massive Damage|Massive Damage]].

